## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Duke-Dennis.md`

### Central Thesis
Duke Dennis is a Type 8 whose adult life is one repeated act — walking out of arrangements other people made for him — and the word "rizz" is just the latest arrangement he's refusing.

