### Changes Made (4)
1. **Syllabus → Stress** (the only genuinely weak seam): added *"The whole syllabus assumes he can leave."* The advice section now sets up "when walking isn't on the table" instead of dropping the reader into Germany.
2. **Stress → Provision**: section now opens *"Money he never withheld."*, picking up the withheld/released axis the previous section closed on ("It was the microphone").
3. **Orphaned thread closed**: the diagnosis promised that hurt "surfaces as force or composure" and never marked its payoff. The Dee-shirt beat now carries the callback — *"Hurt with no channel of its own, surfacing as composure."* The emotional peak reads as evidence, not anecdote.
4. **Paid for with restatement, not beats**: cut *"and said little else about it"* from the Union Square paragraph (the restitution check already establishes payment).

Seven other transitions were checked and left alone — they already carry keywords across the boundary ("inside the contract," "room," "a ranking he can argue with," "one title he accepted," "a gift too").

